<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 5: Communication</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">Whether information flows clearly, openly and in time for people to act on it.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="communication_co1">1. Important information reaches me in time for me to act on it.</label>
        <select id="communication_co1" name="communication.co1">
            <option value="" {% if communication.co1 == "" or communication.co1 == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="1" {% if communication.co1 == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Strongly disagree</option>
            <option value="2" {% if communication.co1 == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Disagree</option>
            <option value="3" {% if communication.co1 == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Neutral</option>
            <option value="4" {% if communication.co1 == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Agree</option>
            <option value="5" {% if communication.co1 == 5 %}selected{% endif %}>5 &mdash; Strongly agree</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="communication_co2">2. Decisions made by leadership are communicated openly and honestly.</label>
        <select id="communication_co2" name="communication.co2">
            <option value="" {% if communication.co2 == "" or communication.co2 == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="1" {% if communication.co2 == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Strongly disagree</option>
            <option value="2" {% if communication.co2 == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Disagree</option>
            <option value="3" {% if communication.co2 == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Neutral</option>
            <option value="4" {% if communication.co2 == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Agree</option>
            <option value="5" {% if communication.co2 == 5 %}selected{% endif %}>5 &mdash; Strongly agree</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="communication_co3">3. My line manager keeps me informed about things that affect my work.</label>
        <select id="communication_co3" name="communication.co3">
            <option value="" {% if communication.co3 == "" or communication.co3 == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="1" {% if communication.co3 == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Strongly disagree</option>
            <option value="2" {% if communication.co3 == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Disagree</option>
            <option value="3" {% if communication.co3 == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Neutral</option>
            <option value="4" {% if communication.co3 == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Agree</option>
            <option value="5" {% if communication.co3 == 5 %}selected{% endif %}>5 &mdash; Strongly agree</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="communication_co4">4. Two-way communication is encouraged here, not just top-down announcements.</label>
        <select id="communication_co4" name="communication.co4">
            <option value="" {% if communication.co4 == "" or communication.co4 == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="1" {% if communication.co4 == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 &mdash; Strongly disagree</option>
            <option value="2" {% if communication.co4 == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 &mdash; Disagree</option>
            <option value="3" {% if communication.co4 == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 &mdash; Neutral</option>
            <option value="4" {% if communication.co4 == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 &mdash; Agree</option>
            <option value="5" {% if communication.co4 == 5 %}selected{% endif %}>5 &mdash; Strongly agree</option>
        </select>
    </div>
</div>
